OL,3,GNEWSAReview says new laws should
OL,4,Aprotect infrastructure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review commissioned by South
OL,7,FYorkshire Mayor Oliver Coppard has said
OL,8,Fthere should be new legislation to
OL,9,Fallow public authorities to purchase
OL,10,Fmajor privately-owned assets threatened
OL,11,Fby closure.
OL,13,FIt followed the closure of Doncaster
OL,14,FSheffield Airport (DSA) in 2022.
OL,16,FAt that point, Doncaster Council -
OL,17,Fbacked financially by the South
OL,18,FYorkshire Mayoral Combined Authority
OL,19,F(SYMCA) - was pursuing a compulsory
OL,20,Fpurchase order (CPO) to take over the
OL,21,Fairport.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
