OL,3,GNEWSAReview says new laws should
OL,4,Aprotect infrastructure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe South Yorkshire Strategic
OL,7,FInfrastructure Inquiry report has now
OL,8,Frecommended that if closing a major
OL,9,Fpublic asset would have a "damaging,
OL,10,Fharmful and detrimental" economic
OL,11,Fimpact, the government should
OL,12,Fintervene.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
